WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:07.020
If Operation Cozy Family continues,
that family may face an unwanted ending!

00:07.020 --> 00:10.930
Aren't there important people to you in there, too?!

00:11.280 --> 00:12.150
How boring.

00:20.230 --> 00:24.750
Come on... I just want to quietly wait for her.

00:24.750 --> 00:27.360
Why won't you leave me alone?

00:28.530 --> 00:29.440
See?

01:51.290 --> 01:54.670
The one and only hubby in this world who is handsome, kind, and charming.

01:54.670 --> 01:58.010
This is a story of a cat-eared wife who loves her husband, meow.

02:19.210 --> 02:21.820
We came without telling Gekka...

02:21.820 --> 02:22.830
Don't worry!

02:22.830 --> 02:26.030
When it comes to it, this Kyouka-sama has a convenient skill called Cellphone,

02:26.030 --> 02:28.790
but instead, I left a note I wrote with my own hand.

02:28.790 --> 02:30.750
I'm so excited. Where are we going?

02:30.750 --> 02:33.740
Yeah, Kitty. It's about time you told us where we're going.

02:33.740 --> 02:35.440
I see an island!

02:35.440 --> 02:38.380
What? It simply looks familiar.

02:38.380 --> 02:39.760
What? What? Which one?

02:40.650 --> 02:42.140
Choukokutou?

02:42.140 --> 02:44.010
Prepare for landing!

02:44.760 --> 02:49.300
Stop! I don't want to suffer a crash landing like we did for the honeymoon!

02:46.890 --> 02:49.300
Let go, Ouka!

02:49.300 --> 02:50.230
I'll navigate the ship!

02:50.230 --> 02:51.690
Everyone! Hold Kyouka down!

02:51.690 --> 02:53.900
What do you think you're doing?!

02:53.900 --> 02:55.010
No, don't bite me!

02:55.010 --> 02:55.790
Dad?

02:55.790 --> 02:56.630
He's fainted.

02:56.630 --> 02:58.470
Someone, take the controls!

02:58.470 --> 02:59.900
I can't do it!

02:59.900 --> 03:00.430
Hyouka!

03:00.430 --> 03:01.280
Okay.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.170
Press.

03:11.750 --> 03:14.710
Choukokutou is the safest place in the world?

03:15.340 --> 03:16.460
This is not Choukokutou!

03:16.460 --> 03:18.760
It is now the People's Republic of Kyouka!

03:18.760 --> 03:20.460
The King, Pierre, is my slave!

03:20.460 --> 03:23.090
The citizens are monkeys who worship this Kyouka-sama!

03:25.100 --> 03:27.740
It's the perfect place to hide quietly for a while.

03:27.740 --> 03:29.440
We came running away from Water, you know?

03:29.440 --> 03:31.100
We're surrounded by water here.

03:34.250 --> 03:36.600
What are you thinking?

03:39.850 --> 03:40.990
Wait, Kyouka!

03:40.990 --> 03:41.850
Wait.

03:57.450 --> 03:58.690
What could be wrong here?

03:58.690 --> 04:02.300
Hey, Pierre! Kyouka-sama's hungry! Hurry and open this door!

04:02.300 --> 04:07.320
You're only good at cooking,
so wield your cooking skills for this god!

04:07.960 --> 04:08.690
Kyouka!

04:14.700 --> 04:16.060
Mujyakey-sama love!

04:16.060 --> 04:19.110
Captain love!

04:20.270 --> 04:22.150
It's the monkeys.

04:22.150 --> 04:24.230
The pirate Mujyakey's subordinates, too?

04:24.230 --> 04:25.710
What's going on here?

04:28.280 --> 04:30.240
Who's trying to kill me?!

04:30.280 --> 04:31.590
Grab on to that!

04:31.590 --> 04:32.370
You're...

04:32.370 --> 04:33.520
Long time no see!

04:33.520 --> 04:34.240
You're right.

04:34.240 --> 04:41.810
I've swept the seven seas, stolen countless treasures,
and am the feared captain of the Purple Skull Pirates.

04:41.810 --> 04:45.380
Mujyakey-san. Save the introduction for later. We need to get everyone out of there first.

04:46.050 --> 04:49.240
Captain!

04:49.240 --> 04:51.520
They're all coming at us.

04:51.520 --> 04:54.270
One, two. One, two. One, two.

04:54.270 --> 04:55.750
You insolent bunch.

04:55.750 --> 04:57.900
What happened to the monkeys?

05:02.540 --> 05:04.320
Hyouka, go easy on them.

05:04.320 --> 05:06.820
That's harder than killing them, Father.

05:06.820 --> 05:07.950
I'll sweep them out, then.

05:08.820 --> 05:09.700
Father!

05:10.120 --> 05:11.990
Mujyakey-sama love!

05:11.990 --> 05:15.280
Captain love!

05:15.850 --> 05:17.410
Stop saying love!

05:17.410 --> 05:18.700
You make me feel sick!

05:22.250 --> 05:24.880
Mujyakey-sama! Don't waste food!

05:24.880 --> 05:27.580
The monkeys took the food away, so supply is very important now.

05:27.580 --> 05:28.890
I know that!

05:28.890 --> 05:34.560
I see. They must be under Water's control
and have gone berserk, following their inner desires.

05:35.220 --> 05:36.440
Monkeys move for food.

05:36.440 --> 05:40.940
And Mujyakey. Your men are fully
expressing their desire to love you.

05:40.940 --> 05:43.150
I told you not to say the word "love"! It's gross!

05:43.150 --> 05:45.360
Um, what do you mean by getting controlled by water?

05:45.360 --> 05:49.330
What we refer to as Water is
an extraterrestrial organism from space.

05:49.330 --> 05:55.380
They look like water, enter the body, and amplify the desires and anxieties that beings carry.

05:55.380 --> 05:59.160
We came here on a spaceship to get away from them.

05:59.160 --> 06:01.090
But thanks to someone...

06:08.640 --> 06:14.230
Now, Pierre and Mujyakey. How did you two survive without getting infected by Water?

06:16.420 --> 06:22.250
For myself, a reason coming to mind is, since I have a weak stomach, I only drink water that has been boiled and sterilized.

06:22.250 --> 06:24.020
Perhaps that protected me?

06:24.020 --> 06:28.450
I see. No wonder you look like you have a weak stomach.

06:28.450 --> 06:31.570
I really don't think how I look matters here.

06:32.040 --> 06:32.950
What about you?

06:32.950 --> 06:36.330
Thinking back, I've been taking in water through fruit, not by drinking water.

06:36.330 --> 06:42.060
I see. So you made your men drink water
while you hogged all the fruit to yourself.

06:42.060 --> 06:43.220
Aren't you high and mighty?

06:43.220 --> 06:45.090
What's that supposed to mean?!

06:45.090 --> 06:47.690
Kyouka. Stop picking needless fights.

06:47.690 --> 06:49.970
I'm just making a clear rationalization of what happened.

06:49.970 --> 06:52.580
What do we do now, Father?

06:52.580 --> 06:55.970
Let's wait for the night to fall,
and then we'll all get out of here.

06:55.970 --> 06:58.250
I'm glad the spaceship is intact.

06:58.250 --> 07:00.060
That really was a close call.

07:01.060 --> 07:02.990
It's no different, wherever you may go.

07:02.990 --> 07:03.770
Kyouka?

07:03.770 --> 07:07.660
If so, I would choose to live here with my family and Pierre, the caterer.

07:07.660 --> 07:08.920
What about me?

07:08.920 --> 07:12.700
If so, I would choose to live here with my family, Pierre, the caterer, and Mujyakey, the extra.

07:12.700 --> 07:15.410
Why am I an extra?!

07:18.740 --> 07:20.600
Kyouka-sama won't go anywhere!

07:22.260 --> 07:22.960
Kyouka?

07:22.960 --> 07:28.210
Ouka. I'm scared that I'll be separated from everyone forever if I leave their side.

07:28.210 --> 07:33.760
Since it's a family made by jumbling people together, it'll be easy to break it if it's tried.

07:57.450 --> 08:01.870
The reason why she did such a ridiculous thing could be a result of her inner anguish.

08:02.810 --> 08:06.490
The bright side is we got to meet Mujyakey-san and Pierre-san.

08:06.490 --> 08:09.620
So let's all work together and manage our way out of this crisis.

08:33.220 --> 08:34.420
Stop the tanks.

08:34.420 --> 08:36.010
All men, take your positions!

08:37.870 --> 08:39.370
Load NP FEED cartridge.

08:40.050 --> 08:41.390
Target confirmed!

08:41.390 --> 08:42.910
Enter the coordinates!

08:50.380 --> 08:51.840
Tank 2, set!

08:51.840 --> 08:53.630
Tank 3, set!

08:55.050 --> 08:56.130
Fire!

08:56.130 --> 08:57.140
Main canon, fire!

09:00.830 --> 09:01.810
Hit confirmed!

09:03.610 --> 09:04.350
What is this?

09:08.530 --> 09:09.610
It didn't have any effect?

09:10.130 --> 09:12.270
That's my restraining wear, you know?

09:12.270 --> 09:17.620
Without it, I'm too strong, and I would end up blowing this small Earth up in a matter of seconds.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.500
I had eight of them at first, and now...

09:25.210 --> 09:26.580
Don't panic! Fire!

09:27.580 --> 09:30.400
Fire! Fire! Keep firing!

09:30.920 --> 09:32.710
The more you attack me...

09:32.710 --> 09:34.220
Three left...

09:34.220 --> 09:37.730
Until Gekka comes back, I can't possibly die.

09:37.730 --> 09:39.750
So could you please stop now?

09:40.460 --> 09:41.890
Two left...

09:43.040 --> 09:44.500
Is it going to attack us?

09:44.500 --> 09:45.770
All tanks, ready to salvo!

09:54.610 --> 09:55.530
What was that?

09:56.920 --> 09:58.490
I-It's a fire!

10:00.900 --> 10:02.880
You shouldn't be damaging the city.

10:02.880 --> 10:05.380
I'm not interested in what you think, Spider.

10:05.380 --> 10:09.650
I ordered people to evacuate the moment Gouyokuou came to Earth.

10:09.650 --> 10:12.230
Yet, the people in Masayume City ignored that.

10:12.230 --> 10:18.720
It's a ghetto filled with criminals and such, so losing a city or two is a minor issue compared to Earth's survival.

10:18.720 --> 10:20.990
Continue the attack!

10:20.990 --> 10:22.560
That damn Million...

10:22.560 --> 10:25.570
Looks like she's pissed.

10:27.640 --> 10:29.100
Continue the attack!

10:29.100 --> 10:29.650
Roger!

10:30.330 --> 10:31.970
That bastard!

10:34.570 --> 10:37.080
I only have two left on me...

10:37.820 --> 10:40.350
That damn monster!

10:40.350 --> 10:42.250
I can't take this anymore!

10:43.340 --> 10:46.000
Wait! Come back! You guys!

10:47.040 --> 10:51.010
The people in this city were
the first people to be kind to me.

10:51.010 --> 10:54.890
They gave me alcohol I couldn't drink
and listened to my love story without laughing.

10:54.890 --> 10:58.010
How could you hurt such great people?!

10:59.510 --> 11:01.400
H-Help me!

11:01.400 --> 11:02.900
Please! Spare my life!

11:07.520 --> 11:09.270
I can't stay here!

11:17.030 --> 11:18.400
Excuse me.

11:18.400 --> 11:21.070
You're the alien in love.

11:21.070 --> 11:23.830
I'm sorry. I'm the cause of this.

11:23.830 --> 11:25.910
Yeah, seriously. What do you plan on doing?

11:27.070 --> 11:31.200
You were so kind to me, yet I've acted as though I was repaying the kindness with ingratitude.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.990
I don't even have any clue how to apologize.

11:32.990 --> 11:34.960
Forget that. What are you doing here?

11:34.960 --> 11:38.460
I wanted to do something I can and came to help you at the very least.

11:39.920 --> 11:43.210
Oh no. The shop's going to burn down.

11:43.210 --> 11:45.310
All the memories between Cat and Onii-chan are burning.

11:46.970 --> 11:48.390
God, what a hard head.

11:48.390 --> 11:49.480
I'm sorry.

11:49.480 --> 11:53.730
You idiot. You look so strong, yet taking part in the water relay is all you can do, you useless...

11:53.730 --> 11:55.110
Even if you say that...

11:55.110 --> 11:58.450
If you're an alien, don't you have
a way of solving this really quick?

12:01.070 --> 12:01.650
Give me a moment!

12:18.840 --> 12:24.020
Water! Do you hear me?!

12:33.720 --> 12:37.490
Hey, can you hear me?!

12:37.490 --> 12:39.190
You're Gouyokuou.

12:39.190 --> 12:41.640
Wow, what a coincidence.

12:41.640 --> 12:43.370
You were here on Earth, too?

12:43.960 --> 12:45.070
I'm...

12:46.590 --> 12:52.660
I wanted to know what the love that you talk of means, and I've come this far.

12:54.980 --> 12:56.680
Are you a god?

12:56.680 --> 12:58.650
You must be Water.

12:58.650 --> 13:01.190
Am I a part of your body?

13:01.190 --> 13:04.100
Sorry, but I'm not your god.

13:04.100 --> 13:06.420
Your god has left this planet.

13:07.280 --> 13:10.750
I'm acting as a deputy god, ordered by your god.

13:11.110 --> 13:13.850
So you're not me?

13:14.370 --> 13:15.750
I'm Gouyokuou.

13:15.750 --> 13:16.850
I'm not you.

13:17.230 --> 13:20.560
We're all connected. We become I only when there's we.

13:20.560 --> 13:23.360
We should feel secure, yet we feel something is absent.

13:23.360 --> 13:27.370
I don't know why, but I've been gazing up at the sky all the time.

13:27.370 --> 13:31.370
But no matter how far out I reach, I can't grab any planets out there.

13:31.370 --> 13:34.330
You're in love, aren't you?

13:35.770 --> 13:36.510
Love?

13:40.660 --> 13:42.100
Just like me.

13:44.040 --> 13:47.330
I don't know what love is.

13:47.330 --> 13:48.960
But, Ouka...

13:49.350 --> 13:50.610
Ouka?

13:50.610 --> 13:54.520
I don't know why, but I feel safe when I'm around Ouka.

13:54.520 --> 13:57.810
I feel safe, yet my heart races.

13:57.810 --> 14:01.610
When I'm around Ouka, those around him become sad.

14:01.610 --> 14:04.160
I become sad, too, but I still want to be with him.

14:04.160 --> 14:08.000
So I continued to stay close to Ouka in water form.

14:09.360 --> 14:11.280
That's probably the definition of love.

14:12.360 --> 14:14.540
This is love?

14:17.140 --> 14:19.580
I'm in love with Ouka?

14:21.270 --> 14:24.680
Oh right! I had a favor to ask you as Water!

14:24.680 --> 14:25.590
Please help me!

14:31.120 --> 14:33.850
I bet that alien just ran away since he couldn't keep acting cool.

14:33.850 --> 14:35.500
He's a nice person.

14:35.500 --> 14:37.640
Cat will believe in that alien.

14:40.110 --> 14:41.270
It's raining!

14:45.140 --> 14:47.280
Thank goodness!

14:51.530 --> 14:53.610
Mother! Father!

14:53.610 --> 14:54.470
Where are you?

14:54.470 --> 14:56.870
You're Bakka Kyoukya's family!

14:58.340 --> 14:59.450
I'm Gekka.

14:59.450 --> 15:00.770
And you are?

15:01.490 --> 15:06.170
I'm Kyupi. Citizen of the underground empire Shangri-La, who praises Bakka Kyoukya as god!

15:07.250 --> 15:08.510
Baka Kyouka?

15:09.220 --> 15:12.480
Sounded like everyone calls her Kyouka-sama.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.680
I've been told to give this to you by Bakka Kyoukya!

15:16.470 --> 15:18.740
Mother really wrote this?

15:18.740 --> 15:20.610
I'm not lying or deceiving you.

15:20.610 --> 15:25.860
Shortly after our reunion, Bakka Kyoukya left this memo with me and left here.

15:25.860 --> 15:28.720
Gekka-sama. We, the citizens of the
underground empire, wish for only one thing!

15:28.720 --> 15:31.170
We wish for Bakka Kyoukya to come back!

15:31.170 --> 15:32.690
It's too calligraphic.

15:32.690 --> 15:35.380
Mother's handwriting is messier than this.

15:35.780 --> 15:38.200
I never imagined this would happen...

15:38.200 --> 15:40.250
I must go to Choukokutou, as well!

15:40.250 --> 15:42.200
So you believe me!

15:42.200 --> 15:45.370
Please bring Bakka Kyoukya back to us!

15:45.370 --> 15:46.750
I hope I'll make it there on time.

15:49.270 --> 15:52.720
I guess it was a mistake to let you live after you stood against your god.

15:53.580 --> 15:55.140
So you've noticed?

15:55.140 --> 15:56.900
My family has nothing to do with this.

15:56.900 --> 15:58.670
Why are you hurting them?

15:58.670 --> 16:01.420
Ah, how entertaining. The god's panicking.

16:01.420 --> 16:02.290
Silence!

16:02.290 --> 16:07.200
It's useless. The Water's all around now.

16:07.200 --> 16:09.280
Even within your family.

16:09.280 --> 16:15.320
Unless you swear to never return to Ocean, they will continue to suffer.

16:44.540 --> 16:45.460
Kyouka!

16:46.330 --> 16:47.020
Stop this!

16:47.020 --> 16:48.640
Let go, Ouka!

16:49.190 --> 16:50.280
Stop it!

16:51.590 --> 16:52.470
Wait, Kyouka!

16:52.470 --> 16:53.780
Transmitting Cellphone.

16:57.760 --> 16:58.900
Kyouka, wait!

16:59.380 --> 17:01.730
What? Kyouka, what's the reason for this?

17:03.710 --> 17:05.380
Mom!

17:05.380 --> 17:06.690
Father!

17:06.690 --> 17:07.830
Mother!

17:10.580 --> 17:12.340
Mom? What?

17:12.340 --> 17:13.440
Kyouka?

17:13.940 --> 17:15.260
Where are your ears?

17:15.260 --> 17:16.780
What's going on?

17:16.780 --> 17:19.190
Water must be inside Kyouka.

17:19.190 --> 17:20.390
That's why she was doing such a thing.

17:20.810 --> 17:24.950
Since the Water's taken over her mind, the ears must have disappeared.

17:24.950 --> 17:29.400
Ouka. Recall what the true intent behind us being gathered was.

17:30.670 --> 17:37.280
It's your duty to find and kill the Child of Enka amongst us.

17:37.280 --> 17:39.580
What is this all of a sudden?

17:39.580 --> 17:44.350
Operation Cozy Family was planned so that this doesn't need to happen.

17:45.070 --> 17:46.400
If the entire family gets along,

17:46.400 --> 17:51.590
the Child of Enka who plans on revenge will learn the beauty of family and will forget about killing humans.

17:51.590 --> 17:53.200
That's what this operation is about.

17:53.800 --> 17:59.890
Besides, you should know that none of us here is the Child of Enka who plans revenge.

18:00.380 --> 18:03.410
The Legend of Enka must have been some kind of mistake.

18:03.410 --> 18:04.390
You think so?

18:06.090 --> 18:07.400
You guys listen, too.

18:08.430 --> 18:12.860
Kyouka-sama is a spiritual being that can't live unless she has a host to parasite.

18:12.860 --> 18:14.780
Vanessa... Kyoukya... Kyouka...

18:14.780 --> 18:18.790
They're all my names, yet none truly identifies me.

18:18.790 --> 18:21.410
Even this body. I don't know to whom it truly belongs to.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.690
Mom?

18:23.690 --> 18:27.310
I've lost my memories of before getting to the underground empire.

18:27.690 --> 18:31.720
Even though I'm such a monster-like creature, Ouka said he liked me.

18:31.720 --> 18:32.340
But...

18:32.340 --> 18:33.740
What's wrong with that?!

18:33.740 --> 18:35.760
Shut up! I'm insecure!

18:35.760 --> 18:38.340
I might not be myself, you know?

18:39.730 --> 18:42.230
You have... You have committed an...

18:42.230 --> 18:44.960
What? Tell me, who am I?!

18:47.110 --> 18:50.230
Can you understand this fear, Ouka?

18:53.570 --> 18:54.490
Kyouka?

18:57.520 --> 18:59.070
You're absolutely right.

18:59.070 --> 19:03.330
None of our kids is the Child of Enka plotting revenge against humans.

19:03.330 --> 19:07.580
I know that well, mostly from living with them.

19:07.580 --> 19:11.580
Then, who is the Child of Enka?

19:12.500 --> 19:14.090
Mom...

19:15.070 --> 19:19.090
Doesn't it make most sense for me to be the one?

19:19.090 --> 19:21.790
Kyouka! You're being controlled by Water!

19:21.790 --> 19:23.920
You're only thinking this because
you're caught up in your insecurity.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.050
Wake up!

19:27.610 --> 19:28.940
What was that bell?

19:35.370 --> 19:37.940
Water. The time has come for you to stop this.

19:37.940 --> 19:39.360
Gekka...

19:39.360 --> 19:41.490
Sorry about the ruckus.

19:41.490 --> 19:43.990
Water is part of my body.

19:45.090 --> 19:48.030
I won't forgive anyone who tries to hurt my family!

19:48.030 --> 19:50.750
Evacuate Mother's body at once!

19:51.990 --> 19:53.750
What if I say no?

19:55.000 --> 19:57.260
I'll extract you forcefully!

19:59.510 --> 20:00.510
Stop it!

20:01.260 --> 20:02.090
Honored Sister?

20:02.090 --> 20:03.970
Don't hurt Mom!

20:03.970 --> 20:05.810
Just like Yuuka said.

20:05.810 --> 20:08.990
Can you really beat your mother, Gekka?

20:10.680 --> 20:12.230
Now...

20:13.650 --> 20:16.870
Go get them, you guys!

20:19.740 --> 20:21.250
Stop this, Kyouka!

20:25.140 --> 20:27.790
Wake up! I do not wish to fight!

20:27.790 --> 20:32.880
It's useless! They're under the control of Water and Mother's Cellphone.

20:32.880 --> 20:34.980
There's no end to this if I go easy on them.

20:39.090 --> 20:40.320
Hyouka!

20:40.320 --> 20:41.460
Are you all right?

20:43.930 --> 20:45.010
Watch out, Yuuka!

21:01.780 --> 21:02.890
Chika-chan!

21:02.890 --> 21:04.580
No!

21:24.230 --> 21:26.090
Stop this right now.

21:27.100 --> 21:28.270
If not...

21:30.850 --> 21:32.020
I will...

21:34.600 --> 21:35.720
...shoot you!

21:36.540 --> 21:37.860
That's the way.

21:38.860 --> 21:42.100
I'm the Child of Enka who will bring about the end of humankind.

21:43.860 --> 21:45.990
Kill me, Ouka.

21:49.810 --> 21:51.930
That's your mission.

23:40.690 --> 23:43.060
Children of the Midarezaki and my husband, Ouka.

23:43.060 --> 23:45.730
Rest assured. I, Kyouka-sama,
am omniscient and omnipotent.

23:45.730 --> 23:49.990
To have met you and lived with you all was a great thing even for this god.

